---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Memflex vs Jev, Mem0, Portkey, GPTCache" desc="Honest comparison: cache ≠ memory, and nobody verifies. Researched October 2026." path="/compare">
<div class="wrap" style="padding:64px 24px 20px">
  <span class="eyebrow">Landscape</span>
  <h1>Cache ≠ memory.<br />And nobody verifies.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Researched October 2026 from docs, pricing pages, and benchmarks — not marketing.</p>
</div>
<section class="block">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card" style="overflow-x:auto">
      <table class="spec">
        <tr><th></th><th>Memflex</th><th>Jev (TypeSafe)</th><th>Mem0</th><th>Portkey</th><th>GPTCache</th></tr>
        <tr><td>Answers repeats, zero LLM</td><td class="tick">✅ core</td><td class="tick">✅ (trained)</td><td class="cross">❌ facts only</td><td class="tick">✅ cached</td><td class="tick">✅ cached</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Calibrated confidence</td><td class="tick">✅ per-reflex</td><td class="tick">✅ RLCD</td><td class="cross">partial</td><td class="cross">❌</td><td class="cross">❌</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Self-correction loop</td><td class="tick">✅ verify + 👎</td><td class="cross">❌</td><td class="cross">❌</td><td class="cross">❌</td><td class="cross">❌</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Cost on repeats</td><td class="tick">₹0</td><td>$42/B tokens</td><td>$19+/mo + tokens</td><td>per-token + Enterprise</td><td>free, self-run</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Multilingual-first</td><td class="tick">✅ 19 langs tested</td><td class="cross">EN-first</td><td class="cross">❌</td><td class="cross">❌</td><td class="cross">❌</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Self-host, 1 command</td><td class="tick">✅ SQLite / Postgres</td><td class="cross">❌ hosted</td><td>partial</td><td>partial / Enterprise</td><td class="tick">✅ + Milvus</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Unseen generalization</td><td class="cross">❌ → LLM</td><td class="tick">✅ trained</td><td class="tick">✅ LLM</td><td class="tick">✅ LLM</td><td class="tick">✅ LLM</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="card rv" style="margin-top:18px;border-color:var(--accent)">
      <h3>Have a doubt? Ask us.</h3>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:0">Confused by the table, or wondering if Memflex fits <b>your</b> stack? Write your question — it lands directly in our inbox.</p>
      <div class="askrow">
        <input id="qname" type="text" maxlength="80" placeholder="Your name (optional)" style="max-width:220px" />
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px">
        <textarea id="q" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="e.g. We run 2 lakh support chats/month on Intercom — will Memflex cut our bill?"></textarea>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="askbtn">Send question</button>
        <a class="btn" href="/#faq">Read FAQ first</a>
      </div>
      <div id="qstatus" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:14px" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:10px">Prefer public? <a href="https://github.com/GetSetHimi/memflex">Open a GitHub discussion →</a></p>
    </div>
    <h2 class="rv" style="margin-top:34px">Don't take our word for it — measured.</h2>
    <p class="lead rv">30 questions customers actually ask — refunds, cancellations, delivery tracking — in English, German, Spanish and French, each asked 3 different ways. Result: 22 answered from memory at ₹0.</p>
    <div class="strip rv" style="margin-top:20px">
      <div><b><em>73.3%</em></b><span>asks served from memory (22/30)</span></div>
      <div><b><em>8</em></b><span>distinct reflexes learned</span></div>
      <div><b>~<em>0.1</em>ms</b><span>memory path (vs seconds on LLM)</span></div>
      <div><b>₹<em>0.24</em></b><span>metered savings on 30 asks</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="lead rv" style="margin-top:20px">At 1 lakh asks a month with 70% repeats, that's roughly 70,000 free answers — about ₹21,000–35,000/month saved, plus instant replies instead of multi-second waits.</p>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:13px">Honest limits: mock-backend latency flatters absolutes — the real delta is memory-path ms vs your LLM's seconds. Hit-rate follows your repeat rate; unique-every-time workloads gain nothing.</p>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:22px">The moat is a combination, not a trick: zero-call repeats + verified memory + multilingual + free self-host. Where giants overlap, Memflex plugs in beside them.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
document.getElementById('askbtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {
  const nameEl = document.getElementById('qname');
  const msgEl = document.getElementById('q');
  const status = document.getElementById('qstatus');
  const btn = document.getElementById('askbtn');
  const name = (nameEl.value || '').trim();
  const msg = (msgEl.value || '').trim();
  if (!msg) { msgEl.focus(); return; }
  btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = 'Sending…';
  status.innerHTML = '';
  try {
    const r = await fetch('https://formsubmit.co/ajax/himi50071@gmail.com', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Accept': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({
        name: name || '(no name given)',
        message: msg,
        _subject: 'Memflex question' + (name ? ' from ' + name : '') + ' (compare page)',
        _template: 'table',
        _captcha: 'false',
        _honey: ''
      })
    });
    if (!r.ok) throw new Error('HTTP ' + r.status);
    status.innerHTML = '<span style="color:#c8ff2e">Sent — thank you! We usually reply within 2 days.</span>';
    msgEl.value = '';
  } catch (e) {
    status.innerHTML = '<span class="muted">Could not send automatically. Please email <a href="mailto:himi50071@gmail.com">himi50071@gmail.com</a> directly.</span>';
  }
  btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Send question';
});
</script>
</Base>
